From f9d7cf3d029431365e008523aee2b75402a71b6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:32:33 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: Search, filter and sort admin events together

Event::listingFilters reads q, kind, sort and dir and returns an error for
each invalid value, which the view shows while the default is used.
Event::listingPage builds the WHERE (title LIKE with ESCAPE '!' plus the
kind equality) and the whitelisted ORDER BY with id as tie-breaker. The
Paginator gets optional where, binds, orderBy and queryParams, runs COUNT
with the same WHERE, clamps the page to the last one and keeps the
non-default filters in the page links.
