Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat: Search and sort the admin events JSON listing

The JSON listing reuses Event::listingFilters and Event::listingPage, so
it accepts q, kind, sort and dir and returns per_page, total, total_pages
and the applied filters along with the events. Invalid params on a JSON
request answer 422 with the errors keyed by param, before querying; the
HTML listing keeps the warning and the defaults.
